WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.039 --> 00:00:13.198
As the owner, open Team → Members & invites, and invite each crew member with the right role.

2
00:00:13.198 --> 00:00:19.472
Create the invite link, then send it by text or email.

3
00:00:19.472 --> 00:00:26.263
To plan the year, open Team Management → Calendar.

4
00:00:26.263 --> 00:00:32.478
Round 9 is next week. You’re not sure yet, so set it to Tentative.

5
00:00:32.478 --> 00:00:33.156
Press Edit.

6
00:00:33.156 --> 00:00:36.910
Quick edit opens right under the round, with Save at the top.

7
00:00:36.910 --> 00:00:46.054
Add the sanctioning body, then Save.

